"id":"L001"},{"actor":"sami","start":8.048,"text":{"en":"This is Part 3, A Day at Cham Furniture. Five people, each doing something now.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثالث، يوم في شام للأثاث. خمسة أشخاص، كلّ منهم يفعل شيئاً الآن."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"sami","start":15.142,"text":{"en":"Before you listen, think. Who works in a furniture workshop?","ar":"قبل أن تستمع، فكّر. من يعمل في ورشة أثاث؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"sami","start":20.628,"text":{"en":"Good morning, everyone. Today we are busy.","ar":"صباح الخير جميعاً. اليوم نحن مشغولون."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"sami","start":25.082,"text":{"en":"Layla is finishing the design for Mr Haddad's sofa.","ar":"ليلى تُنهي تصميم كنبة السيّد حدّاد."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"sami","start":29.344,"text":{"en":"Khaled, you are new here, so today you watch and learn.","ar":"خالد، أنت جديد هنا، فاليوم تشاهد وتتعلّم."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"sami","start":33.99,"text":{"en":"Rana is helping customers in the showroom.","ar":"رنا تساعد العملاء في صالة العرض."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"sami","start":37.556,"text":{"en":"Nour is talking to a customer about a big order.","ar":"نور تتحدّث إلى عميل عن طلب كبير."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"sami","start":41.218,"text":{"en":"I am checking the wood for the frames.","ar":"وأنا أفحص الخشب للهياكل."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"sami","start":44.448,"text":{"en":"We work as a team, and every day we make something beautiful.","ar":"نعمل كفريق، وكلّ يوم نصنع شيئاً جميلاً."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"sami","start":48.974,"text":{"en":"Remember: we always keep the workshop clean and safe.","ar":"تذكّروا: نُبقي الورشة دائماً نظيفة وآمنة."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"khaled","start":53.452,"text":{"en":"Now match each person with what they are doing now.","ar":"الآن طابق كلّ شخص مع ما يفعله الآن."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"khaled","start":57.258,"text":{"en":"Layla.","ar":"ليلى."},"subHold":5.872,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"khaled","start":63.13,"text":{"en":"She is finishing a design.","ar":"تُنهي تصميماً."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"khaled","start":66.0,"text":{"en":"Khaled.","ar":"خالد."},"subHold":5.872,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"khaled","start":71.872,"text":{"en":"He is watching and learning.","ar":"يشاهد ويتعلّم."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"khaled","start":74.55,"text":{"en":"Rana.","ar":"رنا."},"subHold":5.872,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"khaled","start":80.422,"text":{"en":"She is helping customers in the showroom.","ar":"تساعد العملاء في صالة العرض."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"khaled","start":83.748,"text":{"en":"And Nour.","ar":"ونور."},"subHold":5.872,"id":"L019"},{"actor":"khaled","start":89.62,"text":{"en":"She is talking to a customer about a big order.","ar":"تتحدّث إلى عميل عن طلب كبير."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"khaled","start":93.354,"text":{"en":"One action was not needed: cleaning the machines. Nobody is doing that now.","ar":"فعل واحد لم يكن مطلوباً: تنظيف الآلات. لا أحد يفعل ذلك الآن."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"sami","start":99.728,"text":{"en":"Five people, and every line used is or am. Why?","ar":"خمسة أشخاص، وكلّ جملة استخدمت is أو am. لماذا؟"},"subHold":10.829,"id":"L022"},{"actor":"sami","start":110.557,"text":{"en":"Because the briefing says what each one is doing at this moment.","ar":"لأنّ الإحاطة تقول ما يفعله كلّ واحد في هذه اللحظة."},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"sami","start":114.915,"text":{"en":"But two of my lines were not about now. Which, and how can you tell?","ar":"لكنّ جملتين منّي لم تكونا عن الآن. أيّهما، وكيف تعرف؟"},"subHold":12.472,"id":"L024"},{"actor":"sami","start":127.387,"text":{"en":"Every day we make something, and we always keep the workshop clean. Both are routines.","ar":"every day we make something، و we always keep the workshop clean. وكلتاهما روتين."},"id":"L025"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"4ef7e27dcae936c9","bytes":43488,"sha":"df0aca82949f2cff","address":"lines/4ef7e27dcae936c9.mp3"},{"key":"f